Summary:         Fix the TypeError when you draw a second region-download rectangle. removeOtherRectangles is a plain inner function, so `this` is undefined there; use thisControl. Without the fix, rectangle B is not drawn and the tool stops until Cancel (K2GO-566). Drop this patch when iiab#4577 is in the pinned iiab/iiab commit.

diff --git a/roles/maps/templates/index.html.j2 b/roles/maps/templates/index.html.j2
